# Yogurt (needs a machine/brain that can ACK a PROMPT). Leave PROMPT out on
# machines with no button and no app-side ACK path.
DISCONNECT PAUSE
CEILING chamber 120
HOLD food 82
WAIT_GE food 80 1800
EMIT pasteurized
HOLD_OFF
SET fan 1
WAIT_LE food 44 1800
SET fan 0
PROMPT add_culture
SET motor 1
WAIT 30
SET motor 0
HOLD food 43
WAIT 28800
HOLD_OFF
EMIT yogurt_done
HALT
